    "body": "I think so! I think it would make sense that a link header would have a nonce like a preload so that the request could comply with nonce-specific CSP. I don't think nonce should be a preload key though; IIUC it's only meant as a way to allow specific elements fetch resources, it doesn't affect the request itself. /cc @mikewest ",
