    "body": "It's unclear what this sentence should do if attribs[\"referrerpolicy\"] is `\"asdf\"`.\r\n\r\nIt might be better to phrase this in terms of referrer policies, e.g.\r\n\r\n> If attribs[\"referrerpolicy\"] exists and is an ASCII case-insensitive match to some [referrer policy], then set options's referrer policy to that referrer policy.",
